{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "flowd design tokens",
    "theme": "Lagoon Glass",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "updated": "2026-10-03",
    "notes": [
      "CANONICAL. Edit this file, then run `npm run build` in packages/tokens (or `npm run sync` at the repo root).",
      "Alias syntax: \"{color.primitive.azure.600}\" resolves to the referenced value. Everything else is literal CSS colour / number.",
      "Colour spaces: primitives were derived in OKLCH (constant hue per ramp, chroma scaled to each hue's own gamut) and stored as sRGB hex. See scripts/derive-ramps.mjs.",
      "Money is always integer cents in data; these tokens only style it. Mint = money up / cleared. Lagoon = pending / info. Ember = urgency. Sun = Elite / featured. Rose = danger.",
      "Contrast is enforced by `node build.mjs` (lib/contrast.mjs): every text token must clear WCAG AA on every glass layer over the brightest/darkest pixel of the aurora field."
    ]
  },

